      "mathematical_findings": "For every true finite-dimensional standard Gaussian and globally L-Lipschitz real f, including L=0, the all-signed centered Gaussian concentration inequality has exact universal exponent L^2*t^2/2. Zero dimension and t=0 give equality1<=1. Lipschitz/domain facts justify the actual mean; there is no supplied MGF certificate. This is mathematical contract approval only, not local proof/type evidence."
