          "class": "SOURCE / TYPING",
          "reason": "All-positive analytic range and genuine family typing. No neighboring eta<=1 cap or numerical eta<=1/(2beta) cap."
        },
        {
          "definition": "F_s(x)=V(x)+eta_s^-1/2*norm(x-y_s)^2; output p",
          "class": "RULED",
          "reason": "Actual quadratic regularization and constructed measurable unique minimizer. Neither p nor optimality/selector is a premise."
        },
        {
